# Verbatim HTML that must never be reformatted.
# paon-template.html is the founder's own file, served byte-for-byte
# (ADR-048) — prettier rewriting it would silently change the storefront.
# downloaded_pages/* are saved page snapshots kept as visual reference.
# Both are hand-authored HTML with implied closing tags that prettier
# cannot parse, which is what broke `pnpm format:check` in CI.
# The glob avoids a literal path because .prettierignore reads [slug] as a
# character class, not a directory name.
**/paon-template.html
downloaded_pages

# Generated verbatim design sources (ADR-052). Regenerated by script from
